string url in the script that was deleted, returning a 404 error if you tried visiting it. Causing the WHOLE script to break.\n\nSo I tried recovering the code by looking at an old screenshot. Once I did,  I applied it to the original code. However, that didn't work as nothing was happening when I executing the script.\n\nI eventually found out the second problem in which it was the executor I was using. Turns out (no *), my executor was too weak. You can run an UNC test to see how good your executor is, mine ranks 70%, which is an * score. And what does that executor not have that this script requires? The getrawmetatable and the getnamecallmethod library.\n\nRegardless, this script doesn't work anymore, no matter what you try. I spent like over an hour tryna troubleshoot this and it won't work. To those reading this, have the good rest of your day. I probably saved you time.\n\nIf you would like to contact me or just hang out, my Roblox username is kaceplaceholder (https://www.roblox.com/users/7577335182/profile)","createdAt":"2024-11-15T05:31:10.183Z","edited":true,"dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":2,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6736dcec03d9a81bae3241f0","commentBy":{"_id":"6736d9cce8ab3800535cc39e","username":"baydaswitch","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2024-11-15T05:19:08.413Z","lastActive":"2024-11-16T08:11:08.982Z","status":"offline","id":"6736d9cce8ab3800535cc39e","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"If I ever decide to learn more about the Lua language, I bet I can fix this easily. It's like turning a * or switching out the battery.","createdAt":"2024-11-15T05:32:28.629Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6736dcfa5a7d8e8cb4f3b2e1","commentBy":{"_id":"6736d9cce8ab3800535cc39e","username":"baydaswitch","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.